In ancient times, [[Lord Casterwill]] guarded the rings of his personal [[Legendary Titans]] with this curse, and by protecting the rings he effectively protected [[Overlos]] as well. {{sourceneeded}}

When the Ring of [[Araknos]] was disturbed by a young [[Simon Judeau]], he was afflicted by the curse and hospitalized. {{sourceneeded}} In order to circumvent the curse, he made a pact with Araknos, binding their life forces together. {{sourceneeded}}

Later, when the Ring of [[Behemoth]] was disturbed by [[Metz]], he similarly was afflicted and hospitalized under the care of [[Lady S.]] {{sourceneeded}} As the curse protecting the Ring of Behemoth was already activated, [[Dante Vale]] was able to use the ring without falling victim to the curse even though he wasn't wearing the [[Amulet of Will]]. {{source|Ladies' Choice}}

When [[Lok Lambert]] found the Ring of [[Tao]] in [[King Solomon's mines]], he was able to acquire the ring without invoking the curse due to his wearing the Amulet of Will. {{source|To Be Together}}
